            </span>
            <h3>Care streaks</h3>
            <p>Daily care builds a gentle streak: a calm habit tracker that keeps your plants (and you) thriving, never a guilt trip.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== FEATURES ===================== -->
    <section class="section features" id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Everything in the app</span>
          <h2>Know every plant you meet.</h2>
          <p>From a first nervous scan to a full collection, Verdancy is a calm, capable companion for every plant parent.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="card feature">
            <span class="icon-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M20 16v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M8 20H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
